  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAL 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Additional Warning to the Priests",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"And now, you priests, this warning is for you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do not listen, and if you do not resolve to honor my name,\" says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, \"I will send a curse on you, and I will curse your blessings. Yes, I have already cursed them, because you have not resolved to honor me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Because of you I will rebuke your descendants",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; I will smear on your faces the dung from your festival sacrifices, and you will be carried off with it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you will know that I have sent you this warning so that my covenant with Levi may continue,\" says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"My covenant was with him, a covenant of life and peace, and I gave them to him; this called for reverence and he revered me and stood in awe of my name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "True instruction was in his mouth and nothing false was found on his lips. He walked with me in peace and uprightness, and turned many from sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"For the lips of a priest ought to preserve knowledge, because he is the messenger of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty and people seek instruction from his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you have turned from the way and by your teaching have caused many to stumble; you have violated the covenant with Levi,\" says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"So I have caused you to be despised and humiliated before all the people, because you have not followed my ways but have shown partiality in matters of the law.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Breaking Covenant Through Divorce",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do we not all have one Father",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? Did not one God create us? Why do we profane the covenant of our ancestors by being unfaithful to one another?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judah has been unfaithful. A detestable thing has been committed in Israel and in Jerusalem: Judah has desecrated the sanctuary the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loves by marrying women who worship a foreign god.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for the man who does this, whoever he may be, may the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "remove him from the tents of Jacob",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "—even though he brings an offering to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Another thing you do: You flood the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s altar with tears. You weep and wail because he no longer looks with favor on your offerings or accepts them with pleasure from your hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You ask, \"Why?\" It is because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is the witness between you and the wife of your youth. You have been unfaithful to her, though she is your partner, the wife of your marriage covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Has not the one God made you? You belong to him in body and spirit. And what does the one God seek? Godly offspring.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "So be on your guard, and do not be unfaithful to the wife of your youth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The man who hates and divorces his wife,\" says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, \"does violence to the one he should protect,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 2:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "So be on your guard, and do not be unfaithful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Breaking Covenant Through Injustice",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have wearied the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with your words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 2:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"How have we wearied him?\" you ask.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 2:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "By saying, \"All who do evil are good in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAL.2.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he is pleased with them\" or \"Where is the God of justice?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
